{{Top|Lotus|Tenno|Tenno|Weapon|Weapons|Weapons}}
{{WeaponInfoboxAutomatic}}
{{Codex|Chew through the enemy with this vicious automatic hand shotgun.}}

The '''Pyrana''' is a secondary automatic {{Faction|Tenno}} shotgun, available from the [[Research#Tenno Research|Tenno Lab]]. With its fast [[fire rate]] and high {{D|Slash}} damage, the Pyrana can easily decimate groups of lightly armored targets or the [[Infested]]. However, this is counterbalanced by its high [[recoil]] and damage falloff.

This weapon can be sold for {{cc|5,000}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Slash}} damage.

{{Advantages|class=Shotgun Sidearm|
*Innate [[multishot]] of 12 pellets.
*Second highest pellet count of all secondary shotguns, behind {{Weapon|Twin Rogga}}.
*Efficient ammo economy.
}}

{{Disadvantages|class=Shotgun Sidearm|
*Has linear damage falloff from 100% to 27.27% from 15m to 30m target distance (distances are affected by [[Projectile Speed]]).
*Low overall [[status chance]].
*Low [[accuracy]].
*High recoil, especially on full auto.
*Shots goes to the right and up. Horizontally it hits rightmost side of the reticle at 3m, worsening at longer distances.
}}

{{WeaponComparison|Pyrana Prime}}
**Higher [[multishot]] count (12 vs. 10)

==Acquisition==
The Pyrana's blueprint can be [[research]]ed from the [[Research/Tenno Lab|Tenno Lab]] in the [[dojo]].

{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

==Tips==
*While more ammo-efficient than other full-auto secondaries like the {{Weapon|Viper}}, {{M|Pistol Ammo Mutation}}, {{M|Pistol Scavenger}} or [[Squad Ammo Restore]]s can still help counteract the Pyrana's heavy ammo expenditure if fired continuously in full auto.
*To reduce the massive amounts of recoil, use {{M|Steady Hands}}.
*{{M|Barrel Diffusion}} can greatly increase the amount of pellets per shot (a fully ranked Barrel Diffusion can yield up to 26 pellets per shot). Although it can be paired with {{M|Lethal Torrent}} for more pellets, it will increase your rate of fire tremendously and deplete your ammo very quickly.
**However, the net result is 33-34 pellets, the second highest amount of all shotguns, behind the {{Weapon|Twin Rogga}}. Coupled with its high crit chance, it can be a very deadly close-quarters weapon.
**Combining Punch Through mods such as {{M|Seeker}} will make this weapon especially deadly against clustered enemies coming in too close.

==Trivia==
*The weapon's name, design and description are all derived from the [[wikipedia:Piranha|piranha]], an omnivorous freshwater fish that inhabits South American rivers. The piranha is well known for hunting its prey in packs and viciously tearing it apart.

